          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What is the best pole saw for homeowners?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                For most homeowners, a brushless battery pole saw with an 8- or 10-inch bar and around 15 feet of reach is the best fit. The DeWalt DCPS620B is our top pick, and the EGO PS1000 is the premium choice. If you already own a battery platform, buy that brand's pole saw to avoid paying for a new battery and charger.
              </p>
